sentences.text:
Following aspects are considered:-
i. The applicant is a permanent resident of Kachchh, hence would be available at the time of trial;
ii. The applicant does not have any criminal antecedents.

The applicant is ordered to be released on bail in connection with FIR being C.R. No. 11993016250011 of 2025 registered with Cyber Crime Police Station, Kachchh (East Gandhidham), on executing a bail bond of Rs.25,000/- (Rupees Twenty Five Thousand only) with two sureties each of the like amount to the satisfaction of the trial Court and subject to the conditions that he shall;
NEUTRAL CITATION R/CR.MA/6871/2026 ORDER DATED: 27/03/2026 undefined [a] not take undue advantage of liberty or misuse liberty;
[b] not act in a manner injurious to the interest of the prosecution;
Hardik Rajeshbhai Solanki vs State Of Gujarat on 27 March, 2026 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/111086390/
